        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Matte Black Hunner 24 Inch Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hunner 24 Inch Door Pull in Matte Black is easy to install. It can be ordered to accommodate a huge range of door thicknesses and is available in surface mounting, back to back mounting, and thru-bolt mounting. The 24 Inch Mitered Door Pull has a dark, matte black finish that adds to its modern appeal. The Hunner Door Handle has 24 inch mounting centers and is 24-3/4 inches in length overall.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed a different size?  <a href=\"/products/hunner-36-inch-door-pull-in-matte-black\"><b>36 Hunner Inch Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/hunner-48-inch-door-pull-in-matte-black\"><b>48 Hunner Inch Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/hunner-60-inch-door-pull-in-matte-black\"><b>60\" Hunner Inch Door Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/hunner-72-inch-door-pull-in-matte-black\"><b>72\" Hunner Inch Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Mitered Door Pull Doorware Designs RTMPULL24-622:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 24-3/4\" (630mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 24\" (610mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Width: 1-1/2\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTMPULL24-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262424\"><b>DWD-RTMPULL24 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Hunner 24 Inch Door Pull in Matte Black",
                "description": "The Hunner 24 Inch Door Pull in Matte Black is easy to install. It can be ordered to accommodate a huge range of door thickness and is available in surface mounting, back to back mounting, and thru-bolt mounting. The 24 Inch Mitered Door Pull has a dark, matte black finish that adds to its modern appeal. The Hunner Door Handle has 24 inch mounting centers and is 24-3/4 inches in length overall.",
